{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2022-11-10 07:00:00', 'title': 'MEDIA ADVISORY: CORESITE CELEBRATES ITS EXPANDED CHICAGO DATA CENTER FOOTPRINT, ENABLING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION IN A RISING INTERNET HUB', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CORESITE, A LEADING HYBRID IT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER AND SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) (“AMERICAN TOWER”), WILL CELEBRATE ITS DOWNTOWN CHICAGO DATA CENTER, CH2, WITH THE LOCAL BUSINESS COMMUNITY ON THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 17.'}